<Slide style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    background: '#FFFFFF',
    padding: '60px 60px',
    flexDirection: 'column',
    fontFamily: '"Arial", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>
        H1 · RQ1——市场会自我校准吗？
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 10 }}>
        市场是欠分散的
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', width: 1160 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>
                去水后的校准斜率——斜率 1.0 意味着价格本身已经校准。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>48 块 cluster bootstrap · 10,000 次重抽</Text>
        </Box>

        <Image src="assets/fig06.png" style={{ width: 960, height: 347, marginTop: 6 }} />

        <Box style={{ width: 1160, padding: '12px 20px', background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, marginTop: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                比例法去水得到 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>1.086</span> [1.047, 1.124]——
                冷门被高估、热门被低估。Shin 法（1.052）与幂法（1.030，区间跨 1）方向一致，量级不一致。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>DSC5001 · 统计机器学习 I</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>第 32 组 · 6/10</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
